## CI commands

```bash
make fmt-check
make clippy
make test-ci
cargo doc --no-deps --workspace
```

CI exports `UFORGE_SKIP_EMBEDDED_LEMONADE=1` for every Cargo step and uses
`make test-ci` to force live Lemonade integration tests off. Local full
verification continues to use `make test` with the owned embedded runtime.

